<p>Reid earns <strong>$23.28m</strong> in 2026-27, second on the <a href="/teams/charlotte-hornets/">Charlotte</a> payroll behind <a href="/players/coby-white/">Coby White</a>. It follows the <strong>$21.55m</strong> he was paid in the first year of the deal.</p>
<p>His career earnings come to <strong>$77.89m</strong> across eight seasons, all but this one spent at <a href="/teams/minnesota-timberwolves/">Minnesota</a>. The salary is <strong>14.40%</strong> of Charlotte’s <strong>$161.69m</strong> payroll.</p>

