<h2 class="bde-heading-506-117 bde-heading">
What Is Naz Reid’s Contract With the Hornets?
</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-506-118 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-506-141 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-f-text-506-154 bde-f-text">
<p>Reid signed a five-year contract worth <strong>$125m</strong> on July 14, 2025, with every dollar guaranteed and a player option on the final season. Minnesota signed it using his Bird rights, and Charlotte took the contract on when he arrived.</p>
<p>He declined a player option worth about <strong>$15m</strong> on June 27, 2025 to get to that deal, which turned one season into five and raised his pay by roughly <strong>$7.5m</strong> a year. The option on 2029-30 puts the last decision in his hands.</p>

</div><div class="bde-shortcode-506-191 bde-shortcode"><div class="nba-fin" data-nba-fin="proportions">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/_ported/08ba6176394a.css">
