</div>
</div><div class="bde-f-text-506-156 bde-f-text">
<p>Published estimates put Reid’s net worth at around <strong>$3m</strong>. That number reads as a stale one against <strong>$77.89m</strong> in career earnings, most of which has arrived since 2023.</p>
<p>He went undrafted out of Louisiana State in 2019 and started on a two-way contract. Six of his first seven seasons paid less than what he now earns in a month.</p>

